    LLM: 'Game: Perevodnoy Durak. Transfer by equal rank. 36 cards. 2-6p.',
    Player: 'Perevodnoy Durak: transfer attack by playing same rank. Else as Podkidnoy. Last with cards = Fool.',
    objective: 'Get rid of all your cards. The last player holding cards at the end of the game is the Durak (Fool) and loses.',
    gameplay: 'As Podkidnoy Durak, except: defender with card of SAME RANK as first attack card can TRANSFER: play it, attack passes to next player with both cards. New defender can add same rank, transfer again. Cannot transfer if new defender has too few cards to defend. Alternative: beat or pick up.',
    keyRules: [
      'Transfer: play equal rank to pass attack to next player.',
      'Transfer adds your card to attack; next must defend or transfer.',
      'Cannot transfer if new defender cannot defend (e.g. only 1 card vs 2-card attack).',
      'Once a card beaten, transfer no longer possible for that bout.',
      'Otherwise as Podkidnoy: attack, defend, throw in, draw to 6.',
    ],
